  "Notes": [
    {
      "Text": "Security update for gcc13",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for gcc13 fixes the following issue:\n\nUpdate to GCC 13.5:\n\n- CVE-2026-102010: UAF due to improper pointer update when an application calls the `erase_if` function on a binary heap\n  priority queue in `libstdc++` (bsc#1283123).\n",
      "Title": "Details",
      "Type": "General"
    },
